## Bug Tracking

We are tracking several bugs outside the OAuth2 scope handling issue. The most pressing one is related to session timeouts, where users are logged out unexpectedly. This was reported by multiple team members during testing of the user dashboard. I will coordinate with the backend team to gather logs and find a solution.

Additionally, we have some tech debt that we need to address. The current state of our user authentication flow is somewhat convoluted, which could lead to maintenance issues in the future. I propose to set aside some time in our next sprint to refactor this part of the codebase.

