We need to expand our testing strategies for the upcoming releases. Given our recent issues, I suggest implementing more comprehensive unit tests and end-to-end tests. It may also be beneficial to utilize a testing framework such as Jest or Mocha if we haven't done so already. This would allow us to simulate various user interactions and ensure that the OAuth2 implementation is robust.

Moreover, we should review our CI/CD pipeline. Last week, we faced a deployment failure that traced back to a misconfiguration in our environment variables. I recommend setting up a staging environment that mirrors production more closely to catch these issues before they affect users.

